==English==

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*sem-|*meh₁-|*pel- (fold)}}
From {{inh|en|enm|symple}}, {{m|enm|simple}}, from {{der|en|fro|-}} and {{der|en|fr|simple}}, from {{der|en|la|simplex|t=simple|lit=onefold}} (as opposed to {{m|la|duplex|lit=twofold|t=double}}), from {{m|la|semel|t=the same}} + {{m|la|plicō|t=I fold}}. See [[same]] and [[fold]]. Compare [[single]], [[singular]], [[simultaneous]], etc.

Partially displaced native English {{m|en|onefold}}.

